WEBVTT

00:00:01.853 --> 00:00:03.328
Ron: EXCUSE ME.
DO YOU MIND?

00:00:03.372 --> 00:00:05.243
EVERYWHERE ELSE IS FULL.

00:00:05.287 --> 00:00:06.636
NOT AT ALL.

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:13.208
I'M RON, BY THE WAY.
RON WEASLEY.

00:00:13.251 --> 00:00:14.949
I'M HARRY.
HARRY POTTER.

00:00:17.473 --> 00:00:19.475
SO--SO IT'S TRUE.

00:00:19.518 --> 00:00:23.087
I MEAN, DO YOU REALLY
HAVE THE--THE--

00:00:23.131 --> 00:00:24.088
THE WHAT?

00:00:24.132 --> 00:00:25.960
[WHISPERING]
The scar.

00:00:26.003 --> 00:00:28.484
OH. YEAH.

00:00:28.527 --> 00:00:29.920
WICKED!

00:00:33.358 --> 00:00:35.273
ANYTHING OFF THE
TROLLEY, DEARS?

00:00:35.317 --> 00:00:36.666
NO, THANKS.

00:00:36.709 --> 00:00:38.973
I'M ALL SET.

00:00:42.802 --> 00:00:44.674
WE'LL TAKE THE LOT.

00:00:47.068 --> 00:00:49.374
WHOA.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.425
[SQUEAKING]

00:00:56.468 --> 00:00:57.948
BERTIE BOTT'S
EVERY FLAVOR BEANS?

00:00:57.992 --> 00:01:00.298
THEY MEAN
EVERY FLAVOR.

00:01:00.342 --> 00:01:02.953
THERE'S CHOCOLATE
AND PEPPERMINT,

00:01:02.997 --> 00:01:08.741
AND THERE'S ALSO SPINACH,
LIVER, AND TRIPE.

00:01:08.785 --> 00:01:11.918
GEORGE SWEARS HE GOT
A BOGIE-FLAVORED ONE ONCE.

00:01:17.098 --> 00:01:19.100
Harry: THESE AREN'T
REAL FROGS, ARE THEY?

00:01:19.143 --> 00:01:20.710
IT'S JUST A SPELL.

00:01:20.753 --> 00:01:22.886
BESIDES, IT'S
THE CARDS YOU WANT.

00:01:22.929 --> 00:01:25.193
EACH PACK'S GOT
A FAMOUS WITCH OR WIZARD.

00:01:25.236 --> 00:01:27.891
I'VE GOT
ABOUT 500 MESELF.

00:01:27.934 --> 00:01:29.414
[RIBBIT]

00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:31.025
[RIBBIT]
WATCH IT.

00:01:32.069 --> 00:01:33.244
[RIBBIT]

00:01:34.289 --> 00:01:35.942
OH, THAT'S ROTTEN LUCK.

00:01:35.986 --> 00:01:37.814
THEY'VE ONLY GOT
ONE GOOD JUMP IN THEM

00:01:37.857 --> 00:01:39.772
TO BEGIN WITH.

00:01:40.773 --> 00:01:42.340
Harry:
I'VE GOT DUMBLEDORE!

00:01:42.384 --> 00:01:45.039
I GOT ABOUT 6 OF HIM.

00:01:46.736 --> 00:01:48.390
HEY, HE'S GONE.

00:01:48.433 --> 00:01:49.478
WELL, YOU CAN'T EXPECT HIM

00:01:49.521 --> 00:01:52.046
TO HANG AROUND
ALL DAY, CAN YOU?

00:01:52.089 --> 00:01:53.090
[SQUEAKING]

00:01:53.134 --> 00:01:54.265
THIS IS SCABBERS,
BY THE WAY.

00:01:54.309 --> 00:01:55.832
PATHETIC, ISN'T HE?

00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:57.181
JUST A LITTLE BIT.

00:01:57.225 --> 00:01:59.575
FRED GAVE ME A SPELL
THAT'S TO TURN HIM YELLOW.

00:01:59.618 --> 00:02:00.793
WANT TO SEE?

00:02:00.837 --> 00:02:02.012
YEAH.

00:02:05.146 --> 00:02:07.061
AHEM.

00:02:07.104 --> 00:02:09.411
SUN--

00:02:09.454 --> 00:02:11.456
HAS ANYONE SEEN
A TOAD?

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.371
A BOY NAMED NEVILLE'S
LOST ONE.

00:02:13.415 --> 00:02:14.372
NO.

00:02:14.416 --> 00:02:16.983
OH, ARE YOU DOING MAGIC?

00:02:17.027 --> 00:02:18.246
LET'S SEE, THEN.

00:02:18.289 --> 00:02:19.856
AHEM.

00:02:19.899 --> 00:02:24.687
SUNSHINE, DAISIES,
BUTTER MELLOW,

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:26.950
TURN THIS STUPID,
FAT RAT YELLOW.

00:02:26.993 --> 00:02:28.343
[SQUEAKS]

00:02:30.954 --> 00:02:33.435
ARE YOU SURE
THAT'S A REAL SPELL?

00:02:33.478 --> 00:02:35.785
WELL, IT'S NOT
VERY GOOD, IS IT?

00:02:35.828 --> 00:02:38.092
OF COURSE,
I'VE ONLY TRIED

00:02:38.135 --> 00:02:39.832
A FEW SIMPLE ONES MYSELF,

00:02:39.876 --> 00:02:41.965
BUT THEY'VE ALL
WORKED FOR ME.

00:02:45.621 --> 00:02:47.362
FOR EXAMPLE.

00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:50.495
OCULUS REPARO.

00:02:53.672 --> 00:02:55.326
THAT'S BETTER,
ISN'T IT?

00:02:56.632 --> 00:02:59.156
[GASPS]
HOLY CRICKET!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.463
YOU'RE HARRY POTTER!

00:03:01.506 --> 00:03:03.204
I'M HERMIONE GRANGER.

00:03:03.247 --> 00:03:05.249
AND YOU ARE...

00:03:05.293 --> 00:03:07.904
I'M RON WEASLEY.

00:03:07.947 --> 00:03:09.253
PLEASURE.

00:03:09.297 --> 00:03:11.429
YOU TWO BETTER CHANGE
INTO YOUR ROBES.

00:03:11.473 --> 00:03:13.692
I EXPECT WE'LL BE
ARRIVING SOON.

00:03:18.175 --> 00:03:20.873
YOU'VE GOT DIRT
ON YOUR NOSE, BY THE WAY.

00:03:20.917 --> 00:03:22.919
DID YOU KNOW?
JUST THERE.

00:03:22.962 --> 00:03:24.268
[TRAIN WHISTLE BLOWS]

00:03:36.193 --> 00:03:37.401
RIGHT, THEN! FIRST YEARS,
THIS WAY, PLEASE!

